<title>USA: Footstar sees Q1 earnings above estimates.</title>
<headline>Footstar sees Q1 earnings above estimates.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Footstar Inc said Thursday it expects earnings of $0.13 to $0.16 a share for the first quarter ended March 29, compared to analysts' estimates of $0.06 to $0.07.</p>
<p>The company said operating margins improved for its Footaction and Meldisco units due to solid sales growth, better gross margins, effective expense control, and higher-than-planned interest income.</p>
<p>Footstar reported March same-store sales fell 0.9 percent.</p>
</text>
